/* Localizable.strings — every user-facing string in the app.
 *
 * The source of truth is docs/11-COPY-DECK.md. Rows are transcribed from it verbatim, and a
 * string that is not in the deck does not get invented here: CLAUDE.md §6 says add it to the
 * deck in the same commit. ios/scripts/lint.sh rules 7 and 8 read this file — no exclamation
 * marks, and none of the words the deck's voice section rules out.
 *
 * Rows land as the screens that need them land. This first set is what DesignSystem/ renders:
 * the countdown's own words, the readability bands, and the VoiceOver formats — the components
 * build those themselves because a label is part of the view hierarchy, not part of a screen's
 * copy (docs/12 §2).
 */

